{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2023-05-05 08:00:00', 'title': "BNY MELLON TO SPEAK AT BERNSTEIN'S 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': "NEW YORK , MAY 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BNY MELLON (NYSE: BK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ROBIN VINCE, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL SPEAK AT BERNSTEIN'S 39TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK AT 3:30 P.M. ET ON THURSDAY, JUNE 1, 2023."}